app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  on

actions
  ]            ]          tab            on
  [            [          previous tab   on
  tab ]        tab        pane           on
  shift+tab [  shift+tab  previous pane  on
  l            l          pane right     on
  h            h          pane left      on
  f            f          filter         on
  z            z          zoom           on
  o            o          browser        on
  ctrl+r       ^r         rerun failed   on
  R            R          rerun all      on
  J            J          rerun job      on
  x            x          cancel run     off
  r ctrl+r     r          refresh        on
  esc          esc        back           on
  enter        ↵          open           off
  A            A          annotations    off

annotations
  A       A    annotations  on
  up k    ↑/k  up           off
  down j  ↓/j  down         off
  enter   ↵    open file    off
  o       o    browser      off

log
  up k         ↑/k     up            on
  down j       ↓/j     down          on
  pgup b       b/pgup  page up       on
  pgdown f     f/pgdn  page down     on
  u ctrl+u     u       ½ page up     on
  d ctrl+d     d       ½ page down   on
  home g       g/home  top           on
  end G        G/end   bottom        on
  space enter  space   fold          on
  +            +       expand        on
  -            -       collapse      on
  *            *       fold all      on
  e            e       next error    off
  E            E       prev error    off
  w            w       next warning  off
  W            W       prev warning  off
  /            /       search        on
  enter        enter   search        off
  esc          esc     cancel        off
  n            n       next match    off
  N            N       prev match    off
